    <string name="dialog_welcome_title">Welcome to Pocket Tracker!</string>
    <string name="dialog_welcome_title_named">Welcome to Pocket Tracker, %1$s!</string>
    <string name="dialog_welcome_guide">Here\'s how it works, in short:\n\n• Create a Season to start tracking your scores.\n• In the Play tab, choose your deck and record every match with W or L: points and streak update automatically.\n• The Deck tab keeps stats for each deck, along with the Lists (screenshots) you upload.\n• The Stats tab shows you the overall picture of the Season.\n• Played some matches without logging them? Use "%1$s" to catch your totals up.\n\nHave fun, and may your win streaks be long!</string>
